<title>USA: Supertex Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Supertex Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter Ended  Six-Months Ended</p>
<p>					Sept. 30	     Sept. 30,</p>
<p>				    1996	 1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		   $12,920    $10,359  $25,381  $19,516</p>
<p> Cost of Sales		 6,584	5,422   12,894   10,103</p>
<p>   Gross Profit		6,336	4,937   12,487    9,413</p>
<p> Research and development  1,223	1,321    2,534    2,604</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>   administrative	    1,503	1,431    3,097    2,694</p>
<p>   Income from operations  3,610	2,185    6,856    4,115</p>
<p> Interest and other income   365	  307	733	646</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>				   3,975	2,492    7,589    4,761</p>
<p>Provision for income taxes</p>
<p>				   1,272	  773    2,429    1,476</p>
<p> Net income		    2,703	1,719    5,160    3,285</p>
<p> Net income per share	 0.22	 0.14     0.41     0.27</p>
<p>Shares used in per share</p>
<p>   computation		12,499     12,307   12,497   12,275</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
